<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="03">
<name>Transmission/Transaxle</name>
<section id="1001Y_S000S" variety="S000S">
<name>CVT</name>
<ttl id="1001Y_S000S_744HD_T007Y" variety="T007Y">
<name>CVT System [Super CVT-i] (K112/K112F)</name>
<para id="RM000000FSB00OX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="3225H-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000000FSB00OX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___000045400000">
<content5 releasenbr="3">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000FSC00OX"/>)</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Battery Voltage</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the battery voltage.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>NG</result>
<action-ci-right>Charge or replace battery</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>OK</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Control System CAN Communication System Communication Function</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSAN), check the DTCs via [Diagnosis] → [Vehicle Diagnosis/Communication Malfunction CAN Bus Diagnosis] → [Diagnostic Function/Communication Malfunction DTC Check].</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.68in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication Section <xref label="Seep07" href="RM000001R4W009X"/></action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTCs and Freeze Frame Data</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs and freeze frame data.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTCs and Freeze Frame Data</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs and Freeze Frame Data, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the DTC is output again.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If DTCs are output [see DTC Chart <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000IZJ00RX"/>]</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.69in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.44in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTCs normal, problem symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction code is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTCs normal, problem symptom cannot be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Refer to the DTC Chart <xref label="Seep09" href="X39400000QT013D"/>, perform troubleshooting for each code and go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Problem Simulation <xref label="Seep08" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/></action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep03" href="X39400000QW016D"/>)</testtitle>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.68in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not applicable to symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Applicable to symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Perform troubleshooting for the applicable symptom, then go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000000FSN00TX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>G sensor 0-point learning and CVT hydraulic pressure learning (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000021F400AX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000FSD00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>